<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

<p>
  Last updated:
  <%= new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', {
    year: 'numeric',
    month: 'long',
    day: 'numeric'
  }) %>
</p>

<p>
  FLICKCANVAS ("we", "our", or "us") operates the website
  flickcanvas.vercel.app. This Privacy Policy explains how we
  handle information in connection with your use of our website
  and our social media integrations.
</p>

<h2>Information We Collect</h2>

<p>
  FLICKCANVAS primarily provides movie information, posters,
  trailers, ratings, release information, and related content.
  We do not require visitors to create an account or provide
  personal information to browse our movie content.
</p>

<p>
  We may receive limited technical information that is
  automatically provided by your browser or hosting infrastructure,
  such as basic request information, for security and normal
  website operation.
</p>

<h2>Movie Data and TMDB</h2>

<p>
  Movie information, posters, ratings, release dates, descriptions,
  and related movie data displayed on FLICKCANVAS are obtained
  through The Movie Database (TMDB) API and other permitted sources.
</p>

<p>
  TMDB is a third-party service and its own terms and privacy
  policies apply to its services and data.
</p>

<h2>Facebook and Instagram Integration</h2>

<p>
  FLICKCANVAS uses the Meta Graph API to publish movie-related
  content to our official Facebook Page and Instagram Business
  account.
</p>

<p>
  This integration is used to publish content such as movie
  posters, movie titles, ratings, release information, descriptions,
  trailers, and links to FLICKCANVAS.
</p>

<p>
  We do not use this integration to collect personal information
  from visitors or users of our Facebook Page or Instagram account.
</p>

<h2>Pinterest Integration</h2>

<p>
  FLICKCANVAS may use the Pinterest API to automatically create
  and publish Pins containing movie-related content to our official
  Pinterest Business account.
</p>

<p>
  Pinterest Pins may include movie posters, movie titles, ratings,
  genres, release information, descriptions, trailer information,
  hashtags, and links to relevant pages on FLICKCANVAS.
</p>

<p>
  The Pinterest integration is used for publishing and managing
  content on our own Pinterest account. We do not use the Pinterest
  API to collect or process personal information from other
  Pinterest users.
</p>

<h2>Third-Party Services</h2>

<p>
  FLICKCANVAS may use third-party services including:
</p>

<ul>
  <li>The Movie Database (TMDB) for movie information and images.</li>
  <li>Meta Graph API for Facebook and Instagram publishing.</li>
  <li>Pinterest API for Pinterest publishing and account integration.</li>
  <li>Vercel for website hosting and application infrastructure.</li>
</ul>

<p>
  Each third-party service may have its own terms, privacy policies,
  and data practices. We encourage users to review the applicable
  policies of these services.
</p>

<h2>Cookies</h2>

<p>
  FLICKCANVAS may use basic cookies or similar technologies when
  necessary for website functionality, security, analytics, or
  improving user experience.
</p>

<p>
  Third-party services used by the website may also use cookies or
  similar technologies according to their own policies.
</p>

<h2>Advertising</h2>

<p>
  FLICKCANVAS may display advertisements provided by third-party
  advertising services. These services may use cookies or similar
  technologies to deliver, measure, or personalize advertising
  according to their own privacy policies and applicable laws.
</p>

<h2>Data Security</h2>

<p>
  We take reasonable measures to protect information processed
  through our website and connected third-party services.
  However, no internet transmission or electronic storage system
  can be guaranteed to be completely secure.
</p>

<h2>Children's Privacy</h2>

<p>
  FLICKCANVAS does not knowingly collect personal information from
  children. If you believe that a child has provided personal
  information to us, please contact us so that appropriate action
  can be taken.
</p>

<h2>Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>

<p>
  We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes
  will be posted on this page with an updated "Last updated" date.
</p>

<h2>Contact Us</h2>

<p>
  If you have questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy,
  please contact us at:
  <strong>flickcanvasmovies@gmail.com</strong>
</p>
